{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2024-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1709856000, "end_date": 1710547199, "month_true_total": 122, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:23:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "160566581", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034246348", "personaname": "=]NOD[= InZane", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198034246348/", "num_games_owned": 842, "num_reviews": 123, "playtime_forever": 908, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 610, "deck_playtime_at_review": 24, "last_played": 1779476662, "avatar": "58cc43b64d85ef289325a9c15c29643e69777bea"}, "language": "english", "review": "70/100\n\nA decent Left 4 Dead-like that is carried by its great use of its IP and is overall just a few steps* away from beeing \"good\".\nHas to be played with friends to be enjoyed!\n\n\n*balancing patches, a few (end mission) cutscenes, weapons from the movies and a first person view would elevate the experience for me.", "timestamp_created": 1710486178, "timestamp_updated": 1710486178, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160564172", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960414303", "personaname": "whet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197960414303/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1157, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 669, "last_played": 1717074806, "avatar": "408fa5f4aa2011080a86aef18f69395a3b2a661d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This Game + UEVR is one of the best alien expierences that one can have, 1st person + 6DOF motion controls =